  <!-- EN: firefoam blood -->
  <AG_FirefoamBlood.label>sangue de espuma antichamas</AG_FirefoamBlood.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a weird fire retardant mixture for blood. This blood is not potent enough to put down fires, but it will not let flames spread. -->
  <AG_FirefoamBlood.description>Portadores deste gene têm no lugar do sangue uma mistura estranha que retarda o fogo. Não é forte o bastante para apagar incêndios, mas impede as chamas de se espalharem.</AG_FirefoamBlood.description>
  <!-- EN: foam -->
  <AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>espuma</AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>
  <!-- EN: flamma -->
  <AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.1.symbol>flama</AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.1.symbol>
  <!-- EN: foambleeder -->
  <AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>sangra-espuma</AG_FirefoamBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>
  <!-- EN: pebble blood -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.label>sangue de cascalho</AG_PebbleBlood.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have partially crystallized blood, that takes the form of small stone-like pebbles as soon as it comes into contact with air. This blood affects much less the beauty and cleanliness of its surroundings, but takes more time to go away and more work to clean. -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.description>Portadores deste gene têm sangue parcialmente cristalizado, que vira pequenas pedrinhas assim que entra em contato com o ar. Esse sangue afeta bem menos a beleza e a limpeza do ambiente, mas demora mais para sumir e dá mais trabalho para limpar.</AG_PebbleBlood.description>
  <!-- EN: rock -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>pedra</AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>
  <!-- EN: pebble -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.1.symbol>cascalho</AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.1.symbol>
  <!-- EN: litho -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.2.symbol>lito</AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.2.symbol>
  <!-- EN: rock-bleeder -->
  <AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>sangra-pedra</AG_PebbleBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>
  <!-- EN: water blood -->
  <AG_WaterBlood.label>sangue aguado</AG_WaterBlood.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have watered down blood. Their blood is so thin that puddles of it will be virtually indistinguishable from water. -->
  <AG_WaterBlood.description>Portadores deste gene têm o sangue diluído. É tão ralo que as poças são praticamente indistinguíveis de água.</AG_WaterBlood.description>
  <!-- EN: cryo blood -->
  <AG_CryoBlood.label>criossangue</AG_CryoBlood.label>
  <!-- EN: Carriers of this gene have a cryogenic fluid for blood. This liquid will quickly drop the temperature of its surroundings, making it both useful and incredibly dangerous. Dissipates faster than normal blood but can't be cleaned. -->
  <AG_CryoBlood.description>Portadores deste gene têm um fluido criogênico no lugar do sangue. Esse líquido baixa rápido a temperatura ao redor, o que o torna útil e extremamente perigoso. Some mais rápido que o sangue normal, mas não pode ser limpo.</AG_CryoBlood.description>
  <!-- EN: cryo -->
  <AG_CryoBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>crio</AG_CryoBlood.symbolPack.prefixSymbols.0.symbol>
  <!-- EN: cryobleeder -->
  <AG_CryoBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>sangra-gelo</AG_CryoBlood.symbolPack.wholeNameSymbols.0.symbol>
